Error [jet.UsePrivateModuleItem]: `tools: helpers` re-exports `helpers`, a `priv module`
  --> Tests/UI/reexport_private_module.jet:10:12
    |
 10 |     tools: helpers
    |            ^^^^^^^
 Why: A re-export is public, and `priv` keeps `helpers` inside this file
 Fix: Re-export its members one by one: `double: helpers.double`, `half: helpers.half`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0609
